      "result": "Implemented the persistent Rails URL shortener with PostgreSQL-backed links and click counts. `sh start.sh` applies migrations and starts the API in the foreground on `0.0.0.0:8000`; startup instructions are in the README.\n\nVerified the server starts and exercised create (custom and generated codes), duplicate and invalid input responses, malformed JSON, lookups, listing, redirects, and click counting. I also pinned JSON below version 3 because Rails 8.0’s request parser depends on an option removed in JSON 3. No test records were left in the database.",
